---
title: Failback - Reverse Catch-up & Restore Home (WEST to EAST)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OP as Operator
    participant WEST as WEST promoted active
    participant JOB as Reverse CDC job in EAST
    participant EAST as EAST home primary recovered
    participant DRS as dr_state

    OP->>WEST: 1. quiesce writes, freeze active set
    OP->>JOB: 2. run CDC in FAILBACK direction WEST to EAST
    JOB->>WEST: pull changed models, outage-time versions
    JOB->>EAST: import append-only and verify
    OP->>EAST: 3. run_failback in EAST
    JOB-->>EAST: assess_replication - has EAST caught up?
    alt problems remain and not force
        EAST-->>OP: BLOCKED - re-run reverse CDC or set force=true
    else caught up or forced
        EAST->>DRS: reset active_primary = east
        EAST->>DRS: read back and verify
        EAST-->>OP: FAILBACK SUCCESS - steady state resumes EAST to WEST
    end
